---
title: Orchestration loop
---
%% Historical diagram. See docs/operations.md and schema guides for current behavior.
sequenceDiagram
    participant OP as Operator
    participant SW as Dispatcher
    participant S as Supervisor (Sol)
    participant E as Executor (Terra)
    participant R as Reviewer (Kimi)
    SW->>S: bootstrap / resume context
    S-->>SW: decision envelope (dispatch)
    alt executor
        SW->>E: opencode run -s (id) (prompt)
        E-->>SW: chat response + evidence md
        SW-->>S: response template + usage stats
    else reviewer
        SW->>R: opencode run (new session)
        R-->>SW: verdict + evidence md
        SW-->>S: response template + usage stats
    end
    S-->>SW: next decision (dispatch | done | halt)
    SW->>SW: persist state, audit, transcripts
    S-->>SW: done
    SW-->>OP: final report
